// CR 106.1a and 106.4 (mana added to the pool), 601.2 (the spell uses the stack): the pinned
// 2010-08-15 Pyretic Ritual rulings confirm a ritual is an ordinary instant, not a mana ability.
// CR 500.4: unused mana empties at the end of the step. Copy of Narset's Rebuke's AddMana shape.
(
  id: "dark_ritual",
  name: "Dark Ritual",
  face_id: "dark_ritual",
  mana_cost: "{B}",
  types: ["Instant"],
  spell_effect: [AddMana(amount: (b: 3), retention: EndOfStep)],
)
